title: DicomRTTool
abstract: >-
  Services for reading DICOM images, RT structure sets, and dose files, and for
  converting between DICOM RT objects and NumPy arrays, NIfTI files, and
  SimpleITK image handles — including converting prediction masks back into RT
  structures.
